      "order_number": 2,
      "question_text": "Tenglamani yeching: log_2(x - 1) + log_2(x + 2) = 2.",
      "options": {
        "a": "x = 2",
        "b": "x = -3",
        "c": "x = 3",
        "d": "x = 4"
      },
      "correct_option": "a",
      "explanation": "Aniqlanish sohasi: $x - 1 > 0 \\implies x > 1$.\n\nLogarifm xossasidan foydalanamiz:\n$$\\log_2((x - 1)(x + 2)) = 2 \\implies (x - 1)(x + 2) = 2^2$$\n$$x^2 + x - 2 = 4 \\implies x^2 + x - 6 = 0$$\n$$(x + 3)(x - 2) = 0 \\implies x_1 = 2, \\quad x_2 = -3$$\n\n$x > 1$ shartiga faqat $x = 2$ mos keladi.",
      "created_at": "0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"
    },
