    {
      "id": "5838fdea-b9b6-4e59-864b-78ff314f2666",
      "test_id": "d2a92667-73b2-40b5-a5b1-7357e72acf56",
      "order_number": 28,
      "question_text": "Tenglamani yeching: cos(2x) = 0.",
      "options": {
        "a": "pi/4 + pi*k/2, k in Z",
        "b": "pi/2 + pi*k, k in Z",
        "c": "pi/4 + pi*k, k in Z",
        "d": "pi*k, k in Z"
      },
      "correct_option": "a",
      "explanation": "Ushbu trigonometrik tenglamani yechish uchun kosinus funksiyasining xususiy hollaridan foydalanamiz.\n\n**1-bosqich: Kosinus funksiyasining nollarini aniqlash.**\n\nUmumiy holda, $\\cos(\\alpha) = 0$ tenglamasining ildizlari birlik aylanada vertikal o'qda (ya'ni $\\frac{\\pi}{2}$ va $\\frac{3\\pi}{2}$ nuqtalarida) yotadi va quyidagi formula orqali ifodalanadi:\n$$\\alpha = \\frac{\\pi}{2} + \\pi k, \\quad k \\in \\mathbb{Z}$$\n\n**2-bosqich: Berilgan tenglamani yechish.**\n\nBizning tenglamamizda argument $\\alpha = 2x$ ga teng. Shuning uchun:\n$$2x = \\frac{\\pi}{2} + \\pi k, \\quad k \\in \\mathbb{Z}$$\n\n**3-bosqich: $x$ ning qiymatini topish.**\n\nTenglikning ikkala tomonini $2$ ga bo'lamiz:\n$$x = \\frac{\\frac{\\pi}{2} + \\pi k}{2}$$\n\n$$x = \\frac{\\pi}{4} + \\frac{\\pi k}{2}, \\quad k \\in \\mathbb{Z}$$\n\nDemak, tenglamaning yechimi $x = \\frac{\\pi}{4} + \\frac{\\pi k}{2}, \\quad k \\in \\mathbb{Z}$ bo'ladi.\n\nTo'g'ri javob: **A**",
      "created_at": "0001-01-01T00:00:00Z"
    },
